     2	///
     3	/// Characteristics:
     4	/// - Architecture: Bottom-up shift-reduce using an explicit operand and operator stack.
     5	/// - Strengths: Strict linear O(n) performance, bounded constant stack memory, suitable for token streaming.
     6	/// - Trade-offs: Less intuitive error recovery compared to recursive descent; harder to debug grammar states.
